# No API keys required — all models run locally
# Model files are downloaded to the app's user data directory on first use
#
# ASR: SenseVoice (~229MB) — auto-detects zh/en
# Translation: NLLB-200 600M (~350MB) — auto-download via Transformers.js
# TTS: VITS zh (~115MB) + Piper en (~50MB) — download to ~/Library/Application Support/simultaneous-interpreter/models/tts/
